<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
    <title>PXKK — Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        
        :root {
            --black: #050505;
            --black-soft: #0a0a0a;
            --purple: #8A4FFF;
            --purple-hi: #A370FF;
            --purple-lo: #6B2EE0;
            --purple-glow: rgba(138,79,255,0.4);
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --white-soft: #F5F5F5;
            --gray-hi: #B8B8C2;
            --gray-mid: #7A7A88;
            --gray-lo: #4A4A55;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            --border-hi: rgba(138,79,255,0.35);
            --radius: 24px;
            --radius-lg: 32px;
            --radius-pill: 99px;
            --ease: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            --shadow-soft: 0 10px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--white-soft);
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        a { color: var(--purple-hi); text-decoration: none; transition: color .18s var(--ease); }
        img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

        /* FUNDO E LAYOUT */
        .login-page {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(138,79,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 90%, rgba(138,79,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                #040404;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .login-page::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 64px 64px;
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, #000 20%, transparent 90%);
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, #000 20%, transparent 90%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* LADO ESQUERDO (TEXTO) */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            padding: 80px 10%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            z-index: 1;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .hero-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .hero-brand .mark {
            width: 68px; height: 68px;
            display: grid; place-items: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(138,79,255,.15), transparent 70%);
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }
        .hero-brand .mark img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

        .hero-mid { max-width: 700px; margin: 40px 0; }

        .hero-mid h1 {
            font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
            line-height: 0.95;
            color: var(--white);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            letter-spacing: -0.045em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        .hero-mid h1 .accent { color: var(--purple); text-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--purple-glow); }
        .hero-mid p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--gray-hi); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 500px; }

        .hero-bottom {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray-mid); letter-spacing: .02em;
        }
        .stat { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .stat b { color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; }
        .divider { width: 1px; height: 12px; background: var(--border); }

        /* LADO DIREITO (CARD DE LOGIN) */
        .login-panel {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 48px 32px; z-index: 1;
        }

        .login-card {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%; max-width: 440px;
            padding: 56px 48px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hi);
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .login-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; top: -1px; left: 40px; right: 40px; height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--purple), transparent);
            opacity: .8;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0 0;
        }

        .card-head { margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center; }

        .card-head .mini-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--white);
            background: rgba(138,79,255,0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(138,79,255,0.3);
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            letter-spacing: .2em; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .card-head h2 {
            font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
            font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .card-head p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray-hi); line-height: 1.65; }

        .btn-discord {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;
            width: 100%; padding: 18px 28px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple) 0%, #6B2EE0 100%);
            color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none;
            transition: all .25s var(--ease);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -8px rgba(138,79,255,0.5);
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn-discord::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.2), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform .5s var(--ease);
        }

        .btn-discord:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A370FF 0%, #8A4FFF 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -8px rgba(138,79,255,0.7);
            transform: translateY(-2px); color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-discord:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }
        .btn-discord .left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .btn-discord .arrow { position: relative; z-index: 1; transition: transform .2s var(--ease); }
        .btn-discord:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

        .login-foot {
            margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
        }

        .status-pill {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15);
            color: #86efac; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #4ade80; border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #4ade80; animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-dot {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.5); }
            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0); }
        }

        .secure-pill {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: var(--gray-hi); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .secure-pill svg { color: var(--purple-hi); }

        /* RESPONSIVO (CELULAR) */
        @media(max-width: 960px) {
            .login-page { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 60px; }
            .hero { padding: 40px 24px 20px; min-height: auto; }
            .hero-mid { margin: 24px 0; }
            .hero-mid h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 8vw, 48px); margin-bottom: 16px; }
            .hero-bottom { display: none; }
            .login-panel { padding: 20px 24px 40px; }
            .login-card { padding: 40px 28px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="login-page">
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-top">
            <div class="hero-brand">
                <span class="mark"><img src="/logo.gif" alt="Logo"></span>
                <span class="name">PXKK</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-mid">
            <h1>Gerencie seu<br>servidor com<br><span class="accent">precisão total.</span></h1>
            <p>Toda a configuração do seu bot em um painel único, seguro e intuitivo. Controle tickets, verificação, níveis e muito mais.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-bottom">
            <div class="stat"><b>OAuth2</b> Discord</div>
            <span class="divider"></span>
            <div class="stat"><b>Cloudflare</b></div>
            <span class="divider"></span>
            <div class="stat"><b>100%</b> real-time</div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="login-panel">
        <div class="login-card">
            <div class="card-head">
                <span class="mini-tag">Autenticação</span>
                <h2>Bem-vindo<br>de volta</h2>
                <p>Autentique-se com sua conta do Discord para acessar o painel administrativo.</p>
            </div>
            
            <a href="/auth" class="btn-discord">
                <span class="left">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.3 4.4A19.7 19.7 0 0 0 15.4 3l-.3.5a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 4.3 2.2 15 15 0 0 0-12.8 0A14.6 14.6 0 0 1 10.9 3.5L10.6 3a19.7 19.7 0 0 0-4.9 1.4C2.6 8.6 1.9 12.7 2.3 16.7a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6 3l.8-1.3a13 13 0 0 1-2-1l.5-.4a14 14 0 0 0 12.8 0l.5.4a13 13 0 0 1-2 1l.8 1.3a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6-3c.5-4.6-.7-8.6-3.4-12.3ZM9 14.6c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4S7.8 9.8 9 9.8s2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4S10.2 14.6 9 14.6Zm6 0c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4s1-2.4 2.2-2.4 2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4-1 2.4-2.2 2.4Z"/></svg>
                    Entrar com Discord
                </span>
                <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
            
            <div class="login-foot">
                <div class="status-pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> Online</div>
                <div class="secure-pill">
                    <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                    Seguro
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>